SUMMARY:
* Added hourly output for all downscaled nests thru 01-12 forecast hours
* Added gust and visibility to all downscaled output files.
* Replaced surface pressure with downscaled surface pressure in all output files.
* Added option to downscale NAM nest  to extended conus nest 2.5 km grid 184
* Added option to downscale HRW guam run.
* Switched to use NAM_SMINIT.CTL file to configure downscaled domains
* put in vertical structure and on svn
* added smartinit.ver to configure model and code versions.
Switched to Standard Grid 184 for conus2p5 run
Turned off Guam option for this implementation

put in https://svnemc.ncep.noaa.gov/projects/smartinit/tags/RB-v3.2.0

1.  check out to /nwprod/smartinit.v3.2.0
2.  build sorc codes nam_smartinit.fd, nam_smartprecip.fd
3.  Use smartinit.ver if desired
4.  See bjobcards-dev for recommended memory limits
    to use in JNAM_SMINIT job.
5.  Set RUNTYP,cyc, ffhr from ecflow script as currently done.
    


